        "custom": "Pokémon"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Elétrico. O corpo de Electabuzz descarrega eletricidade constantemente. Aproximar-se dele faz os cabelos ficarem em pé. Pesquisadores estudam maneiras de armazenar raios dentro deste Pokémon para que essa energia possa ser utilizada a qualquer momento.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 9 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 5 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Humanoide &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 75% M / 25% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 2/3</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Electabuzz pode evoluir para Electivire no nível 12 ou superior enquanto segura um Electirizer. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Charge, Leer, Quick Attack, Thunder Shock</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Low Kick</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Swift</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Shock Wave</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Thunder Wave</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Electro Ball</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Light Screen</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Thunder Punch</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Discharge</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Screech</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Thunderbolt</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>16</td><td>Thunder</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>17</td><td>Giga Impact</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Attract, Body Slam, Brick Break, Bulk Up, Charge, Charge Beam, Confide, Covet, Double Team, Double-Edge, Dual Chop, Eerie Impulse, Electric Terrain, Electro Ball, Electroweb, Endure, Facade, Fire Punch, Fling, Focus Blast, Focus Punch, Frustration, Giga Impact, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Hyper Beam, Ice Punch, Iron Tail, Knock Off, Light Screen, Low Kick, Low Sweep, Magnet Rise, Mega Kick, Mega Punch, Metal Sound, Metronome, Protect, Psychic, Rain Dance, Rest, Return, Rising Voltage, Rock Smash, Round, Screech, Shock Wave, Signal Beam, Sleep Talk, Snore, Substitute, Supercell Slam, Swagger, Swift, Take Down, Taunt, Tera Blast, Thief, Thunder, Thunder Punch, Thunder Wave, Thunderbolt, Toxic, Trailblaze, Uproar, Volt Switch, Wild Charge</p>",
